{"server":"tw","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_08_end","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_08","title":"羅德島大食堂","storyCode":"DT-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"d6a06d657d7bf1906487be089f2c0c3c42d0ca224c825cc1f1e7b9b7f54ee0d4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒地吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔法……魔法……嗯，感覺無論用什麼魔法都會傷到小刻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位，請你們幫我壓制住小刻，我來安撫她的情緒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說是這麼說，但是這傢伙也太鬧了吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先西，我們之前吃的爆米花還有剩下的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丟一把給小刻試試！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"話音未落，先西就從口袋中掏出一把爆米花，朝著刻俄柏丟去。\n而剛才還在發怒的刻俄柏立刻像是被吸引住了一樣看向爆米花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，她還是想吃東西的——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是她在路上吃了些什麼東西，把肚子吃壞了，所以才變成了這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的會有人吃壞了肚子變成魔物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生和我說過，小刻的身上有特殊的血脈，的確是有這種可能的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的假的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之後再聊吧，趁現在把小刻壓制住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿劍的，背鍋的，你們兩個看起來力氣比較大，我們一起控制住她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯&先西","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"趁著刻俄柏在吃爆米花的時候，三人小心地從背後接近，分別抱住她的三條腿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不開心地吼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁現在，阿米婭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"回來吧，小刻……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"別害怕，這裡是你的家呀……！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1424_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（痛苦吼叫）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好厲害，她用的魔法我從來沒看過……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快看，小刻變回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻，你沒事吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……剛剛……怎麼了……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像……做了個夢……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刻俄柏環視四周，原本擺放整齊的房間被撞得七扭八歪，自己手中還抓著半個壞掉的玩具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起……火神大姐說了，做錯了事就要說對不起，我好像做錯事了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在夢裡好餓……肚子咕嚕地叫了一下……然後……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"然後……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我就長出了好多個腦袋，想吃很多很多東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要肚子吃飽了，我就很高興，就又回到這裡來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……角峰，火神在哪裡？她最近有發現這個狀況嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我等一下去問問她……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"角峰","speakerId":"avg_199_yak_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）那小刻現在……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……咕嚕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？小刻，你肚子又餓了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想吃好多好多東西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在夢裡吃飽了，但現在還是很餓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道，一個長著三個頭的怪物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠是……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不只是三個頭，是一千個頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻每次都想吃好多好多的東西，長十個……一百個，啊不對，一千個！一千個腦袋都吃不夠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻有一千個腦袋喔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要肚子吃飽了，我就不會變成剛剛那樣了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！那老夫現在就好好地做一頓飯給你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這次先破例在飯前就給小刻吃一點零食，再帶她做一下檢查……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"幾位客人，不如你們先在羅德島上好好逛逛，等開飯時間再大展身手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……多、多謝了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"至於各位來到羅德島的另一個目的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"回到你們原本的地方……我們可能需要一些時間來瞭解你們的事情，然後再做出判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……那我們現在……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不用太過擔心，博士和凱爾希醫生或許會有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。無論如何，你們幫助過小刻，而且，情況也非常特殊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你們不介意的話，就先在羅德島上停留一段時間吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我代表羅德島歡迎你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又來新人了？是哪個部門的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，看不出種族呢，是把尾巴藏起來了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫剛看到有位小姐抱著很多作物過去了，能帶老夫去看看你們這裡的田地嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員A","speakerId":"avg_npc_973_1","isRemote":false,"text":"田地……是說培養艙、水培艙之類的嗎？跟我來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們這裡有酒館嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員B","speakerId":"avg_npc_972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……噢，原來你是杜林人！那過來吧，在這邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們……你們這裡有可以好好洗一個澡、梳理一下頭髮的地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員C","speakerId":"avg_npc_971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗，宿舍裡都有喔，跟我來吧~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好長的兔子耳朵，上次沒有看清楚裡面毛細血管的分布，有點可惜……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，他們會巧妙地調整尾巴的位置來維持身體平衡……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……明明長了羽毛卻沒有翅膀，那他們會飛嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這裡簡直是天堂……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他就是剛剛說的新幹員嗎？是不是迷路了又不好意思開口麻煩別人，所以就站在路中間了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能是有點害羞，要不然我們先去開口打個招呼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問你……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）所以這些鳥人會下蛋嗎？如果是沒有受精的蛋的話，能夠拿來吃看看味道嗎？這裡這麼多人，應該可以要到一些吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）羊人的毛能不能用來做毛衣呢？可是剛才看到的幾個人，手臂似乎很光滑，不像是會長毛的樣子。好可惜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）不過還有更值得在意的事情，好想知道貓人和狗人生下來的孩子是貓還是狗？還是說是半貓半狗？……上貓下狗？左貓右狗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）……那要是和鳥人一起生呢？是生下來一顆蛋，然後從裡面破殼出來一隻貓嗎？嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（集體後退半步）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（再次集體後退半步）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有個問題想問一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的幹員們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（再一次集體後退半步）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們圍在這裡做什麼呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會下蛋嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你在問我嗎？我肯定不會。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她肯定也不會。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"Mon3tr，他一定沒問你，你不用專門出來回答。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？啊！不好意思，我是想問剛剛那幾個鳥……黎博利的……咦？他們都去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家怎麼都站得離我那麼遠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"再也不好奇的幹員D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭！就是他！就是他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"再也不好奇的幹員E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他不是病人，是剛剛被發現在甲板上醒來的……“客人”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"再也不好奇的幹員F","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是他、他他他一直在碎碎唸超級可怕的問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……他問什麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"再也不好奇的幹員D","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他問我們會不會生下半貓半狗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"再也不好奇的幹員E","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他問黎博利會不會生蛋，能不能吃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鳴）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊，好帥喔，你叫Mon3tr嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以摸你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（尖銳的嘶鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（俐落的動作）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——呃啊？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，那你平常在迷宮裡冒險，都沒有辦法好好保養頭髮，卻仍然有著這麼一頭好看的金髮嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼~因為頭髮對魔法師而言是很重要的，頭髮裡面也有一部分我的魔力~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你看，這個是我平常用來保養頭髮的油膏，裡面加了香料和藥草提取物，可以有效滋潤和防護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蜜蠟","speakerId":"avg_344_beewax_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要經常塗抹，才能有現在這樣的效果呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，好香的油膏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是想要頭髮變得好看，我還有很多編髮小技巧可以教給你們哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、跑、什、麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫只是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛用我的火做了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我問你剛剛用我的火做了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……烤栗子……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"avg_166_skfire_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"avg_166_skfire_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烤！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"avg_166_skfire_1","isRemote":false,"text":"栗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"avg_166_skfire_1","isRemote":false,"text":"子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烤栗子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個開拖拉機的小姐給了老夫一些生栗子，說這是她在羅德島上種出來的第一批栗子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這裡的田地打理得很好，栗子作為零食是很不錯的食物，烤熟後香甜軟糯，殼也好剝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜剛剛你身上的火有點大了！這幾個栗子都烤焦了。說要做一頓飯給你們嚐嚐，沒想到卻浪費了食材，老夫覺得很慚愧……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"avg_166_skfire_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"avg_388_mint_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天火學姐、天火學姐，你別生氣啊……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"avg_388_mint_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊，阿消，阿消！快來！天火學姐又燒起來了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"avg_388_mint_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大叔，你也別再往裡面丟肉串了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嚕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的好喝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——不過都說了我不是杜林人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"avg_264_f12yin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"avg_264_f12yin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你其實是個小孩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能坐下來說話嗎，我根本看不到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山","speakerId":"avg_264_f12yin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經坐下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"再來一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"銀灰","speakerId":"avg_172_svrash_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這裡的男性都這麼高嗎？萊歐斯好像也沒有這麼高……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）這個銀白色、毛茸茸的人……萊歐斯要是看到他，大概只會想著問他需不需要幫他梳梳毛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……算了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"都在這裡喝酒？怎麼不叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好久沒來一趟，你們都不記得讓我也來喝看看了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哪裡來的小孩子？小孩可是不能喝酒的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕嚕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這裡有好香的味道！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（飯已經煮好了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（好吃的在這裡！！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝啊！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫的腰——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗚啊，撞到人了……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火神大姐說了，撞到人要說對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起鬍子大叔！撞到你是因為我餓了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，都端上來吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用我們一路上遇到的人提供的食材和回憶做的飯，已經全部做好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吃吃看，和之前的味道還一樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……剛剛準備食材的時候就想問了，為什麼這次還要做一模一樣的料理呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和之前吃的料理味道一樣的話，心情會更好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……這個老夫也不是很確定。但是吃到一模一樣的食物的話，老夫總是會想起上一次吃下同樣食物時的心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像說到蠍子火鍋，瑪露希爾你會想起什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……第一次在新手廣場，和你見面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走路菇的腳也很好吃，有一股奇特的香味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蠍子蠻難拆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴西利斯克呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼也要把解毒草放進雞肉裡烹飪成食物給那個探險者吃下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴西利斯克很帥氣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾終於吃到她想吃的雞肉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼德拉草呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"牠的頭長得很有特色！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪露希爾被大蝙蝠……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那件事就不要再提了啦！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物是和記憶連接在一起的，吃到同樣的料理，腦中也會出現那時的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫做飯的時候也會想起當時一起做飯的人，為什麼會選擇做這道料理？準備食材時發生了什麼事？吃完之後有沒有露出幸福的笑容？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣子一點一滴，都會在同樣的香氣和味道裡再次浮現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這一頓飯的畫面，也會作為這份料理的新的記憶存在在腦海中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先西總是能說出很厲害的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，開飯吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開心的小隊","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"開飯囉！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"54_i12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯~蘿蔔料理好好吃喔！博士要不要試試？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不試試嗎？真的嗎？烤源石蟲很好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"吃一個吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇……這些小刻都可以吃嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可以的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全部都可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"全部都可以喔~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們對小刻真好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了……“博士”，是嗎？老夫剛剛有注意到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛煮飯時那些幹員和老夫說，你經常忙著做事，忘了吃飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不就總是隨便吃一頓就好了，有時還吃一些不健康的提神或是充飢用的食品……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣很不好，要記得這對健康沒有好處，還有不少人都在關心你呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒有……","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"沒錯，就是我。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"烤源石蟲真的好好吃。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"先西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，要想獲得一個強壯的身體，就要保持良好的作息！按時吃三餐！還要適當運動！知道了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，謝謝你們願意幫助我們，我在這裡認識了不少新朋友呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……要是法琳也在這裡就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊歐斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃完這頓飯，你們能和我們詳細地講一下這裡的事情嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？你看我幹嘛，你也想喝酒？也不是不行……但首先，你成年了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇爾查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴著帽子看不出來啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……這個好好吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要記下這道料理是怎麼做的，等救回法琳，就把這道菜做給她吃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候我要跟她講，我們在救她的路上，遇到了很多很好的人，收穫了很多很好的回憶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪露希爾","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她一定會很開心的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["赫拉格"]}]}
